{"id": 4622, "title": "Too many hobbies", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "too-many-hobbies", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4622_too-many-hobbies.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["小杨今年8岁，常常让爸爸妈妈不高兴。他说他想学画画，每个星期天妈妈都不休息，和他一起坐车到学校去。可是只学了两个月，他说画画不容易，不想学了。他又说想学唱歌，爸爸就请老师来家里教他，现在刚学了一个月，他就说唱歌也没意思。爱好太多，但是不能坚持。现在爸爸妈妈不知道怎么办了，是不是别的孩子也这样呢？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["小楊今年8歲，常常讓爸爸媽媽不高興。他說他想學畫畫，每個星期天媽媽都不休息，和他一起坐車到學校去。可是只學了兩個月，他說畫畫不容易，不想學了。他又說想學唱歌，爸爸就請老師來家裡教他，現在剛學了一個月，他就說唱歌也沒意思。愛好太多，但是不能堅持。現在爸爸媽媽不知道怎麼辦了，是不是別的孩子也這樣呢？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Xiǎo Yáng jīn nián 8 suì， cháng cháng ràng bà ba mā ma bù gāo xìng。 tā shuō tā xiǎng xué huà huà， měi gè Xīng qī tiān mā ma dōu bù xiū xi， hé tā yī qǐ zuò chē dào xué xiào qù。 kě shì zhǐ xué le liǎng gè yuè， tā shuō huà huà bù róng yì， bù xiǎng xué le。 tā yòu shuō xiǎng xué chàng gē， bà ba jiù qǐng lǎo shī lái jiā lǐ jiāo tā， xiàn zài gāng xué le yī gè yuè， tā jiù shuō chàng gē yě méi yì si。 ài hào tài duō， dàn shì bù néng jiān chí。 xiàn zài bà ba mā ma bù zhī dào zěn me bàn le， shì bù shì bié de hái zi yě zhè yàng ne？"], "english_paragraphs": ["Xiao Yang is 8 years old this year and often makes his parents unhappy. He said he wanted to learn to draw, and his mother would take a car to school with him every Sunday. But after only two months of learning, he said that painting was not easy and he didn’t want to learn it anymore. He also said that he wanted to learn to sing, so his father invited a teacher to come to his home to teach him. Now that he has just learned it for a month, he says that singing is boring. I have too many hobbies, but I can’t stick to them. Now parents don’t know what to do. Are other children like this too?"], "english_full": "Xiao Yang is 8 years old this year and often makes his parents unhappy. He said he wanted to learn to draw, and his mother would take a car to school with him every Sunday. But after only two months of learning, he said that painting was not easy and he didn’t want to learn it anymore. He also said that he wanted to learn to sing, so his father invited a teacher to come to his home to teach him. Now that he has just learned it for a month, he says that singing is boring. I have too many hobbies, but I can’t stick to them. Now parents don’t know what to do. Are other children like this too?", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Xiǎo Yáng\" data-defn=\"Xiao Yang; a common personal name\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">小杨</span><span class=\"tr\">小楊</span><rt>Xiǎo Yáng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jīn nián\" data-defn=\"this year\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">今年</span><span class=\"tr\">今年</span><rt>jīn nián</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">8</span><span class=\"tr\">8</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"suì\" data-defn=\"classifier for years (of age)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cháng cháng\" data-defn=\"frequently; often\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">常常</span><span class=\"tr\">常常</span><rt>cháng cháng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ràng\" data-defn=\"to permit / to let sb do sth / to have sb do sth / to make sb (feel sad etc)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bà ba\" data-defn=\"(coll.) father; dad\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gāo xìng\" data-defn=\"happy / glad / in a cheerful mood\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">高兴</span><span class=\"tr\">高興</span><rt>gāo xìng</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"he; him; his\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué\" data-defn=\"to learn / to study / to imitate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huà huà\" data-defn=\"to draw; to paint\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">画画</span><span class=\"tr\">畫畫</span><rt>huà huà</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Xīng qī tiān\" data-defn=\"Sunday\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">星期天</span><span class=\"tr\">星期天</span><rt>Xīng qī tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</sp